1
00:01:40,440 --> 00:01:43,200
Designer Aries?

2
00:01:45,240 --> 00:01:46,440
What's so special about him?

3
00:01:47,840 --> 00:01:48,520
He's fair-skinned,

4
00:01:48,960 --> 00:01:50,160
has a pleasant voice.

5
00:01:50,560 --> 00:01:51,320
And he's very gentle,

6
00:01:52,040 --> 00:01:53,040
reminds me of Dad.

7
00:01:57,280 --> 00:01:57,800
Mom.

8
00:01:58,520 --> 00:01:59,560
I miss Dad.

9
00:02:00,200 --> 00:02:02,240
Does he miss me while abroad?

10
00:02:02,840 --> 00:02:03,920
It's been so long.

11
00:02:04,040 --> 00:02:05,400
He hasn't contacted me at all.

12
00:02:17,600 --> 00:02:18,440
Of course, he does.

13
00:02:19,720 --> 00:02:20,240
Liluo.

14
00:02:21,520 --> 00:02:22,240
Your dad

15
00:02:22,880 --> 00:02:25,000
is making big money for us overseas.

16
00:02:29,480 --> 00:02:30,000
Mom.

17
00:02:30,680 --> 00:02:31,800
Do you miss Dad?

18
00:02:36,760 --> 00:02:37,520
I do.

19
00:02:39,800 --> 00:02:40,440
Of course.

20
00:02:45,520 --> 00:02:46,600
Time to sleep, babe.

21
00:03:18,720 --> 00:03:19,640
Who is this guy?

22
00:03:19,720 --> 00:03:21,440
He could even attract Liluo?

23
00:03:24,320 --> 00:03:26,960
It's all that Yan Xiaoxiao's fault.

24
00:03:28,120 --> 00:03:30,400
Liluo is having a rough time lately.

25
00:03:38,760 --> 00:03:39,560
For your daughter,

26
00:03:39,680 --> 00:03:41,800
investigate a designer named Aries.

27
00:03:42,120 --> 00:03:43,480
What designer?

28
00:03:43,960 --> 00:03:46,080
The one who won the sailboat competition award?

29
00:03:46,600 --> 00:03:48,320
How did Liluo get to know him?

30
00:03:48,760 --> 00:03:49,720
Come to my place

31
00:03:49,720 --> 00:03:51,040
and tell me all about it.

32
00:03:51,400 --> 00:03:52,600
Come comfort me.

33
00:03:54,600 --> 00:03:55,600
You!

34
00:03:56,160 --> 00:03:56,960
I'll be there soon.

35
00:04:11,800 --> 00:04:13,360
In today's top news,

36
00:04:13,400 --> 00:04:16,360
renowned designer Aries has won the gold award

37
00:04:16,440 --> 00:04:19,480
at the International Sailboat Hotel Design Competition

38
00:04:19,600 --> 00:04:22,600
for his latest masterpiece 'Galaxy'.

39
00:06:12,600 --> 00:06:13,280
Lauren.

40
00:07:40,800 --> 00:07:42,280
What are you looking at, Liluo?

41
00:07:42,760 --> 00:07:44,680
A drawing that won the Sky Dome Award.

42
00:07:45,160 --> 00:07:46,400
It's a souvenir from a friend.

43
00:07:48,280 --> 00:07:49,480
Who drew

44
00:07:49,720 --> 00:07:50,520
this drawing?

45
00:07:53,240 --> 00:07:54,240
Aries,

46
00:07:54,760 --> 00:07:56,480
a somewhat famous designer.

47
00:07:57,080 --> 00:07:58,800
We've had some interactions lately.

48
00:08:00,240 --> 00:08:01,440
Aries?

49
00:08:01,800 --> 00:08:05,760
Is he the one who won the International Sailboat Hotel Design Competition?

50
00:08:05,960 --> 00:08:06,920
Can you ask him

51
00:08:07,200 --> 00:08:09,560
if he can work for Zhengyan Group?

52
00:08:11,400 --> 00:08:12,280
I'm not sure.

53
00:08:12,720 --> 00:08:14,720
We only have some interactions for now.

54
00:08:16,360 --> 00:08:17,560
Then can you help me

55
00:08:17,840 --> 00:08:19,000
arrange a meeting with him?

56
00:08:20,400 --> 00:08:20,920
Why

57
00:08:21,360 --> 00:08:22,680
do you want to see him?

58
00:08:23,480 --> 00:08:26,080
He's different from those violent people you deal with.

59
00:08:26,640 --> 00:08:27,640
Don't scare him off.

60
00:08:29,200 --> 00:08:30,800
I won't, Liluo.

61
00:08:31,200 --> 00:08:34,200
Haven't you noticed I've become much more refined lately?

62
00:08:35,280 --> 00:08:36,000
Uncle.

63
00:08:36,240 --> 00:08:37,360
I'm all grown up now.

64
00:08:37,800 --> 00:08:39,320
Keep our distance.

65
00:08:45,120 --> 00:08:46,640
I'll arrange a meeting for you.

66
00:08:49,280 --> 00:08:51,080
You are the best.

67
00:08:51,360 --> 00:08:52,160
Alright.

68
00:08:52,520 --> 00:08:53,320
You should go now.

69
00:08:54,200 --> 00:08:56,280
I need to find that idiot Jin Junyi.

70
00:08:56,880 --> 00:08:58,520
After Lu Yuanyuan beat him up

71
00:08:58,600 --> 00:09:00,080
at Doll Bar last time

72
00:09:00,360 --> 00:09:01,600
and he got that injection,

73
00:09:02,040 --> 00:09:03,480
I wonder if he's back to normal.

74
00:09:04,040 --> 00:09:05,680
Otherwise, he always looks so down,

75
00:09:05,760 --> 00:09:06,920
annoying me.

76
00:09:07,040 --> 00:09:07,800
Okay.

77
00:09:08,240 --> 00:09:09,160
Okay.

78
00:09:09,560 --> 00:09:10,680
Go ahead.

79
00:09:23,040 --> 00:09:23,680
Liluo.

80
00:09:25,680 --> 00:09:27,640
It's time for your fake dad

81
00:09:28,480 --> 00:09:31,440
to give gifts to your future boyfriend.

82
00:10:00,400 --> 00:10:01,120
Zhengyan.

83
00:10:01,680 --> 00:10:02,400
Long time no see.

84
00:10:20,520 --> 00:10:21,960
The richest man in Stellarport,

85
00:10:22,200 --> 00:10:24,120
are you comfortable living here?

86
00:10:24,360 --> 00:10:25,400
He Zhengnian.

87
00:10:25,440 --> 00:10:26,880
You scum!

88
00:10:27,920 --> 00:10:29,160
Once I get out,

89
00:10:29,520 --> 00:10:31,000
I'll never let you off.

90
00:10:31,000 --> 00:10:32,320
What?

91
00:10:33,640 --> 00:10:35,800
Say something nice

92
00:10:35,840 --> 00:10:36,800
and beg me now.

93
00:10:37,240 --> 00:10:38,160
Maybe

94
00:10:38,400 --> 00:10:40,680
I'll show you some mercy.

95
00:10:44,040 --> 00:10:45,560
You? Mercy?

96
00:10:45,800 --> 00:10:47,560
I was your boss once,

97
00:10:47,800 --> 00:10:49,840
and I'll always be your boss.

98
00:10:55,360 --> 00:10:57,120
Do you want to know about Liluo?

99
00:10:57,680 --> 00:10:58,520
Say it!

100
00:10:58,560 --> 00:11:00,920
What's wrong with my Liluo?

101
00:11:04,320 --> 00:11:05,640
Speak up.

102
00:11:09,200 --> 00:11:10,440
Say it.

103
00:11:12,680 --> 00:11:15,880
She recently met a top designer.

104
00:11:16,160 --> 00:11:17,080
His name is Aries.

105
00:11:17,400 --> 00:11:18,840
She's head over heels for him.

106
00:11:19,120 --> 00:11:19,640
You!

107
00:11:19,720 --> 00:11:20,720
What did you say?

108
00:11:21,280 --> 00:11:22,440
Liluo is still young.

109
00:11:22,720 --> 00:11:24,320
How dare you let her date a guy?

110
00:11:24,560 --> 00:11:25,960
Her mother has been formidable her whole life.

111
00:11:26,080 --> 00:11:27,240
How could she not care?

112
00:11:28,600 --> 00:11:30,440
This time, it's Zhengyan Group

113
00:11:30,600 --> 00:11:32,680
that wants to invite that top designer

114
00:11:32,960 --> 00:11:34,040
to join.

115
00:11:35,520 --> 00:11:36,520
Same old rules.

116
00:11:37,320 --> 00:11:39,560
Sign this agreement,

117
00:11:40,160 --> 00:11:41,400
and everything will be fine.

118
00:11:42,800 --> 00:11:43,800
No way.

119
00:11:44,960 --> 00:11:46,040
Tell me,

120
00:11:46,440 --> 00:11:48,240
why are you letting Liluo date?

121
00:11:50,280 --> 00:11:51,480
This Aries

122
00:11:52,160 --> 00:11:54,720
has won the International Architecture

123
00:11:55,680 --> 00:11:57,480
Sky Dome Award.

124
00:11:58,360 --> 00:11:59,880
Liluo has good taste.

125
00:12:00,240 --> 00:12:01,480
Everything in the company

126
00:12:02,240 --> 00:12:03,920
will be hers in the future.

127
00:12:06,080 --> 00:12:08,320
As long as you behave

128
00:12:09,760 --> 00:12:10,800
and stay here

129
00:12:11,240 --> 00:12:13,400
as Zhengyan Group's puppet,

130
00:12:14,520 --> 00:12:15,680
I guarantee

131
00:12:15,880 --> 00:12:17,800
Liluo will be safe.

132
00:12:20,440 --> 00:12:21,560
If you don't sign,

133
00:12:22,160 --> 00:12:23,000
then Liluo

134
00:12:23,320 --> 00:12:25,160
won't have anyone protecting her.

135
00:12:29,000 --> 00:12:31,360
All you know is to threaten me using Liluo.

136
00:12:31,640 --> 00:12:32,880
What is this document?

137
00:12:39,120 --> 00:12:41,480
It's asking you to give up five percent of your shares

138
00:12:42,080 --> 00:12:43,920
to invite this top designer

139
00:12:44,040 --> 00:12:46,280
into Zhengyan Group.

140
00:12:50,120 --> 00:12:52,280
If he marries Liluo,

141
00:12:52,720 --> 00:12:53,840
then these shares

142
00:12:54,320 --> 00:12:55,880
will still go to her.

143
00:12:57,760 --> 00:12:59,040
Just sign it.

144
00:13:02,440 --> 00:13:03,800
You!

145
00:13:05,600 --> 00:13:07,440
Move. Let me see.

146
00:13:11,800 --> 00:13:14,840
If Liluo ever gets hurt because of Aries,

147
00:13:15,960 --> 00:13:18,040
I will kill you.

148
00:13:28,760 --> 00:13:29,680
You!

149
00:13:30,760 --> 00:13:31,560
He Zhengnian,

150
00:13:32,280 --> 00:13:33,400
you'll end up in tragedy.

151
00:13:33,640 --> 00:13:35,280
You'll end up in tragedy!

152
00:13:42,720 --> 00:13:43,680
Old man,

153
00:13:43,920 --> 00:13:45,120
you're still quite strong.

154
00:13:45,600 --> 00:13:46,480
I'm leaving.

155
00:13:47,840 --> 00:13:48,640
He Zhengnian.

156
00:13:49,000 --> 00:13:50,200
He Zhengnian!

157
00:14:03,200 --> 00:14:03,680
Zizhou.

158
00:14:04,320 --> 00:14:05,840
I bought this building.

159
00:14:07,240 --> 00:14:09,720
This is where we decided to become family.

160
00:14:10,520 --> 00:14:11,080
In the future,

161
00:14:11,600 --> 00:14:14,360
we'll make the whole Chinatown lively.

162
00:14:19,960 --> 00:14:23,120
I heard Zong Hai from that family died.

163
00:14:24,720 --> 00:14:25,640
I heard it too.

164
00:14:26,040 --> 00:14:29,840
He and that Yan family woman were impaled by steel bars together.

165
00:14:30,120 --> 00:14:33,360
Who would go to that haunted Heisongpo for a secret date?

166
00:14:33,920 --> 00:14:35,320
They died horribly.

167
00:14:37,360 --> 00:14:38,560
Mind your words.

168
00:14:38,680 --> 00:14:40,320
It's all those people from Zhengyan Construction

169
00:14:40,360 --> 00:14:42,840
who ruined the feng shui of this Chinatown area.

170
00:14:43,800 --> 00:14:45,520
This area does feel a bit eerie.

171
00:14:45,720 --> 00:14:46,680
I already told my daughter,

172
00:14:46,720 --> 00:14:49,040
Yangtao, to move away from there

173
00:14:49,120 --> 00:14:50,600
and go to a place with lively energy.

174
00:14:50,800 --> 00:14:52,520
Socialize more with young people.

175
00:14:52,920 --> 00:14:53,600
Exactly.

176
00:14:53,800 --> 00:14:54,920
Do you all know?

177
00:14:55,120 --> 00:14:56,480
My husband said

178
00:14:56,720 --> 00:14:59,040
the land under our building was once a burial ground.

179
00:14:59,200 --> 00:15:00,480
It's often haunted.

180
00:15:02,080 --> 00:15:02,480
You!

181
00:15:02,600 --> 00:15:03,320
Old man!

182
00:15:03,560 --> 00:15:04,280
Looking to die?

183
00:15:04,480 --> 00:15:04,920
Asking for a beating?

184
00:15:04,960 --> 00:15:05,920
Do you want how to drive?

185
00:15:05,960 --> 00:15:06,840
See my car's coming, yet you stand still in the way?

186
00:15:06,880 --> 00:15:08,160
You almost hit me and you're blaming me?

187
00:15:08,680 --> 00:15:10,080
That's my husband's voice.

188
00:15:10,320 --> 00:15:11,720
I need to go check.

189
00:15:11,960 --> 00:15:12,160
Don't leave

190
00:15:12,160 --> 00:15:13,480
Let's all go help.

191
00:15:13,600 --> 00:15:14,400
Don't let him get hurt.

192
00:15:14,480 --> 00:15:15,440
Okay, let's all go.

193
00:15:15,480 --> 00:15:16,120
Hurry up.

194
00:15:16,160 --> 00:15:16,520
Hurry up.

195
00:15:16,600 --> 00:15:17,040
Hurry up.
